_id":"01a0aa45-b608-7908-950f-9b629a53d4c1"},"text":"这年九月，曹操进入荆州，刘琮率领部众投降。曹操得到刘表的水军，水军和步兵共有几十万人"},{"kind":"text","text":"，将士们听说后都十分恐惧。孙权召见群臣，询问对策。众人都说：“曹操像豺狼虎豹一样凶猛，但他假托汉朝丞相的名义，挟持天子征讨四方，动不动就以朝廷的名义发布号令。如今拒绝他，事情在名义上反而更加不顺。而且将军能够抵抗曹操的依仗，只有长江。现在曹操得到荆州，已经占有了这片地方。刘表训练水军，蒙冲、斗舰多达数千艘，曹操把这些船全部用来沿江航行，又加上步兵，水陆并进。这样一来，长江的险要已经和我们共同拥有了。至于双方兵力多少，更是无法相提并论。我们认为，最好的办法不如迎降。”"}],"narrative_time":{"mode":"events","status":"resolved","year_key":"gregorian:206","precision":"year","event_refs":["evt_000006","evt_000007","evt_000008"],"period_key":"gregorian:206:year","year_label":"206年","observations":[{"event_ref":"evt_000006","precision":"year","normalized":{"year":206,"calendar":"proleptic_gregorian","precision":"year","conversion_status":"year_only"},"original_text":"十一年","source_calendar":{"system":"chinese_lunisolar_regnal"}},{"event_ref":"evt_000007","precision":"range","normalized":{"year":208,"calendar":"proleptic_gregorian","precision":"range","conversion_status":"partial"},"original_text":"十三年春","source_calendar":{"system":"chinese_lunisolar_regnal"}},{"event_ref":"evt_000008","precision":"unknown","normalized":{"year":208,"calendar":"proleptic_gregorian","precision":"month","conversion_status":"partial"},"original_text":"其年九月","source_calendar":{"system":"chinese_lunisolar_regnal"}}],"period_label":"（月份未明确）","from_block_id":null,"continues_previous":false},"context_entities":[{"kind":"person","name":"周瑜","entity_ref":"ent_000001","importance":"primary","event_roles":[{"role":"主將","event_ref":"evt_000006","participant_index":0},{"role":"前部大督","event_ref":"evt_000007","participant_index":1}],"canonical_id":"01a0aa45-b607-71bc-a1e9-99184836d1eb","source_anchor_ids":["anc_06d0f8a1455c3524","anc_3644e8e1e31f21ee","anc_40782070f79cf257","anc_438e1b8b94908f4a","anc_49dc9989bd208871","anc_4db97f3e72a78be1","anc_53c741fdaf197ff0","anc_5897fad6ea64925d","anc_613a486a7ced2064","anc_6cd6a0f4643ee51c","anc_6fe6bc47100a7516","anc_710fe9ccee1f5300","anc_a087c126a2d66a86","anc_c380ec073eddfcab",